🏦 Smart Bank REST API Documentation

Base URL

http://localhost:8080

API Base Path

/api/accounts
1. Create New Account
Method
POST
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Headers
Content-Type : application/json
Request Body
{
    "accountHolderName": "Rahul Kumar",
    "accountType": "SAVINGS",
    "balance": 25000,
    "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
    "mobile": "9876543210"
}
Response
{
    "accountId": 3,
    "accountHolderName": "Rahul Kumar",
    "accountType": "SAVINGS",
    "balance": 25000,
    "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
    "mobile": "9876543210"
}
