}
5. Delete Account
Method
DELETE
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1
Response
Account deleted successfully
6. Deposit Money
Method
PUT
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/deposit/1/5000
Meaning
Account ID = 1
Deposit Amount = 5000
Response
{
    "accountId":1,
    "accountHolderName":"Subham Behera",
    "balance":55000
}
7. Withdraw Money
Method
PUT
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/withdraw/1/2000
Meaning
Account ID = 1
Withdraw Amount = 2000
Response
{
    "accountId":1,
    "accountHolderName":"Subham Behera",
    "balance":53000
}
8. Transfer Money ⭐
Method
PUT
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/transfer
Headers
Content-Type : application/json
Request Body
{
    "senderId":1,
    "receiverId":2,
    "amount":5000
}
Response
Money transferred successfully
Example

Before:

Account 1 = 50000
Account 2 = 10000

After:

Account 1 = 45000
Account 2 = 15000
